<title>POLAND: PEKPOL NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 30,000.</title>
<headline>PEKPOL NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 30,000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.03 vs   0.18</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.18 vs   0.35 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.38 vs   0.37 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   16.70 vs  15.65</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.22 vs   2.03</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.97 vs   2.87</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.28 vs   1.64</p>
<p> Sales		  181.39 vs 155.35</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish meat processing company is</p>
<p>Pekpol SA. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
